      "content": "I strongly advise against taking any potassium supplements in this situation, even a small amount, without your doctor's explicit approval. Kidney disease significantly alters how your body manages electrolytes, and what seems like a small dose could cause dangerous imbalances. Please try talking to your doctor's office again to see if they can offer advice over the phone while you wait for an appointment.",
      "source": "target",
