    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "helppp i feel like u arent really helping me... i just want to know if it's actually dangerous or if ur just being extra cautious? i've heard that 99mg is a really tiny dose and most people take way more than that for deficiencies. if i take one every morning, is that really gonna hurt me that much? i just need to know if i can just do this myself for a few days until i see the doc.",
